夢のキャンバスに 居続ける意味は
the meaning of lingering on the canvas of dreams

323
00:31:20,638 --> 00:31:26,598
この胸に 輝いている ストーリー
shines in my heart as this story.

324
00:31:39,039 --> 00:31:44,299
与えることに 意味などないけど
Though there's no meaning in giving,

325
00:31:44,879 --> 00:31:50,639
拾い集めた カケラ 失うの？
will I lose the fragments I gathered?

326
00:31:51,399 --> 00:32:00,019
そして夜は その冷たさを 溶かして手を伸ばした
And at night, I reached out my hand, melting that coldness.

327
00:32:00,719 --> 00:32:06,319
もういいよ 遠くても 届けたい 私は
It's fine now, even far away, I want to reach you.

328
00:32:07,459 --> 00:32:13,279
受け入れてく 涙も抱きしめていたいのに
Even though I want to embrace my tears as I accept them,

329
00:32:14,119 --> 00:32:19,539
夢のキャンバスに 心 込めるのは
what I pour my heart into on the canvas of dreams

330
00:32:19,839 --> 00:32:26,139
この空に 描き出していく ストーリー
is the story being drawn across this sky.

331
00:32:37,839 --> 00:32:48,379
そして夜は その冷たさを 溶かして手を伸ばした
And at night, I reached out my hand, melting that coldness.

332
00:32:48,699 --> 00:32:54,019
もういいよ 遠くても 叶えたい 私の
It's fine now, even far away, my wish to make it real,

333
00:32:54,459 --> 00:33:00,719
こんな世界 想いも 言葉で包んだ
in this world, wrapping even my feelings in words.

334
00:33:01,399 --> 00:33:06,959
夢のキャンバスに 色足してゆく
Adding color to the canvas of dreams,

335
00:33:07,179 --> 00:33:12,239
この胸に 今 輝いて
shining brightly right now in my heart.

336
00:33:12,399 --> 00:33:17,699
強くなくてもいい 笑いかけてもいい
It's okay not to be strong, it's okay to smile through it.

337
00:33:18,099 --> 00:33:24,499
この心は 永久に羽ばたいて 響くように
So this heart will soar forever and resonate,

338
00:33:25,339 --> 00:33:31,999
塗り替えていく パレット
repainting the palette.

339
00:34:01,419 --> 00:34:05,999
だって僕は星だから stellar stellar
Because I'm a star, stellar stellar.

340
00:34:27,020 --> 00:34:31,480
きっと 君はもう気付いていた
I'm sure you had already noticed

341
00:34:31,480 --> 00:34:35,900
僕の心の奥で描いた
what I drew deep within my heart.

342
00:34:35,900 --> 00:34:40,480
それがこれから話す陳腐なモノローグさ
This clichéd monologue I'm about to tell you.

343
00:34:40,480 --> 00:34:44,940
ずっと言えない言葉があった
There were words I could never say,

344
00:34:44,940 --> 00:34:48,920
壊せない壁があったんだ
a wall I couldn't break down.

345
00:34:48,920 --> 00:34:54,440
ふっと 香り立つ朝の匂いが どうしようもなく憎らしくて
The scent of morning wafting up was unbearably hateful,

346
00:34:54,440 --> 00:34:59,080
部屋の隅で膝を抱えて 震えていた
sitting in the corner of my room, hugging my knees and trembling.

347
00:35:00,398 --> 00:35:03,168
太陽なんて いらないから
I don't need the sunshine, don't want it in my life,

348
00:35:05,198 --> 00:35:08,158
明けないでいて
can dawn please stay away?

349
00:35:09,488 --> 00:35:12,168
その手を伸ばして
Hold your hand out all the way

350
00:35:12,968 --> 00:35:16,568
誰かに届くように
and reach out to make someone feel.

351
00:35:17,368 --> 00:35:22,268
僕だって 君と同じ
We're very alike, indeed, both you and me,

352
00:35:22,568 --> 00:35:29,568
特別なんかじゃないから 明けないで
neither of us is special, so please stay away!

353
00:35:31,068 --> 00:35:34,568
そうさ僕は夜を歌うよ Stellar Stellar
So I sing now through this night, stellar stellar,

354
00:35:34,768 --> 00:35:37,368
ありったけの輝きで
shining as bright as any eye can take.

355
00:35:37,868 --> 00:35:41,868
今宵音楽はずっとずっと止まない
My music will never ever be stopped tonight.

356
00:35:42,368 --> 00:35:48,868
そうさ僕がずっとなりたかったのは 待ってるシンデレラじゃないさ
What I wanted to be was never a Cinderella who waits forever,

357
00:35:50,868 --> 00:35:55,268
迎えに行く王子様だ
but the prince who goes and gets things done.

358
00:35:56,568 --> 00:36:02,168
だって僕は星だから
Just like the shooting star I have become.

359
00:36:10,206 --> 00:36:13,566
なんてありふれた話なんだ
Yeah, right. A run-of-the-mill story, and that's all,

360
00:36:13,766 --> 00:36:17,066
理想だけ書き連ねていた
