361
00:36:17,166 --> 00:36:21,166
ノートの隅に眠るほんのワンシーンだ
This scene so trivial scribbled in the margins.

362
00:36:21,566 --> 00:36:24,766
きっとあの星も泣いているんだ
I'm sure the stars in the sky are letting tears fall.

363
00:36:25,166 --> 00:36:30,166
明日なんて 来ないままでいて
Can tomorrow never come, can it please stay away?

364
00:36:31,566 --> 00:36:35,266
その手を伸ばして 誰かに届くように
Hold your hand out all the way. Reach out and make someone feel.

365
00:36:39,966 --> 00:36:52,566
本当に大切なものは 目に見えないみたいなんだ
The truly important things in life are painfully invisible to the naked eye.

366
00:36:54,166 --> 00:36:57,266
そうさ僕は夜を歌うよ Stellar Stellar
So I sing now through this night, stellar stellar,

367
00:36:57,366 --> 00:37:00,166
ありのまま考えないで
just true to myself, make no mistake.

368
00:37:00,366 --> 00:37:04,166
今宵音楽はずっとずっと止まない
The music can never, ever be stopped tonight.

369
00:37:05,166 --> 00:37:12,166
そうさ僕がずっとなりたかったのは あえかなヒロインじゃないさ
What I wanted to be was never just a damsel in distress forever,

370
00:37:13,166 --> 00:37:17,966
救いに行くヒーローだ
but a knight in shining armor.

371
00:37:23,066 --> 00:37:37,066
夢見がちなおとぎ話 おとぎ話
It is so fairytale, a total fantasy...

372
00:37:42,366 --> 00:37:45,566
そうさ僕は夜を歌うよ Stellar Stellar
So I sing now through this night, stellar stellar,

