00:37:45,666 --> 00:37:48,566
ありったけの輝きで
shining as bright as any eye can take.

374
00:37:48,666 --> 00:37:52,566
今宵音楽はずっとずっと止まない
The music will never, ever be stopped tonight.

375
00:37:53,566 --> 00:37:56,566
そうさ僕は愛を歌うよ Stellar Stellar
So I sing now through my love, stellar stellar,

376
00:37:56,666 --> 00:37:59,566
世界宇宙の真ん中で
in the midst of this world and all of space.

377
00:37:59,666 --> 00:38:03,266
今宵音楽はずっとずっと止まない
The music can never, ever be stopped tonight.

378
00:38:04,166 --> 00:38:12,166
そうさ僕がずっとなりたかったのは 待ってるシンデレラじゃないさ
What I wanted to be was never a Cinderella who waits forever,

379
00:38:13,166 --> 00:38:17,566
迎えに行く王子様だ
but the prince who goes and gets things done.

380
00:38:18,166 --> 00:38:23,566
だって僕は星だから
Just like the shooting star I have become.

381
00:38:31,566 --> 00:38:39,566
そうだ僕は星だった Stellar Stellar
The shooting star I have been all along, stellar stellar.

382
00:38:42,566 --> 00:38:49,056
Stellar Stellar

383
