404
00:41:09,364 --> 00:41:13,264
で、このスエットなんだけど、トワね、
Now, about this sweatshirt, you know,

405
00:41:13,264 --> 00:41:23,064
すごいいつもグッズを出すときに考えてるのは、お外にも着ていけて、いける、いける、お外にも着ていけるそんなグッズを出したい！
whenever I release goods, I always think about wanting to release something you can wear outside too.

406
00:41:24,064 --> 00:41:29,064
ということで、こんな感じのおしゃれのセットになりました！いぇーい！
So it became a stylish sweatshirt like this! Yay!

407
00:41:30,064 --> 00:41:36,564
も、トワもね実物はもう見てるんだけど、すごい普段着できるような服なので、みんなね一緒に着てください！
Well, I've already seen the real thing, it's clothes you can easily wear everyday, so everyone please wear it together!

408
00:41:36,964 --> 00:41:38,964
いぇーい！で、
Yay! And,

409
00:41:39,364 --> 00:41:44,564
この3つ全部、あの揃ったものをフルセット買っていただくと、なんと！だだだだーん！
if you buy the full set with all three of these items together, guess what! Tada!

410
00:41:45,064 --> 00:41:46,864
じゃあ、はい！もう
So, yes! This time

411
00:41:46,864 --> 00:41:52,264
今回はみなさんノー喧嘩、何もう、買い逃したとかないです！
everyone, no fighting, no missing out!

412
00:41:52,264 --> 00:41:57,064
トワがね、サインを1枚1枚直筆で書きたいと思うので、
Towa wants to sign every single one by hand,

413
00:41:57,064 --> 00:42:01,564
ぜひぜひフルセット買ってくれたら嬉しいなと思います！はい！
so I'd be really happy if you could buy the full set! Yes!

414
00:42:02,064 --> 00:42:07,564
で、このグッズはねこの配信が終わってから購入できるようになるので、購入してください！はい！
And you'll be able to purchase these goods after this stream ends, so please buy them! Yes!

415
00:42:09,164 --> 00:42:13,564
はい、以上グッズのご紹介でした！単品でもね買えるのでね、いっぱい買ってください！はい！
Yes, that was the introduction of the goods! You can also buy them individually, so please buy lots! Yes!

416
00:42:17,364 --> 00:42:22,564
ま、というわけでね、トワ様トワのソロがすくねぇんじゃねぇかと思ったそこのお店
Well, with that said, for those of you thinking Towa's solo songs are a bit few,

417
00:42:22,564 --> 00:42:25,564
あなた、あなた、あなた、トワ
you, you, you, Towa

418
00:42:28,064 --> 00:42:34,064
この後ね、ラスト頑張っていきたいと思いますので最後まで聞いてってね、よろしくー！
is going to do her best for the last part, so please listen all the way to the end, thanks!

419
00:42:35,064 --> 00:42:39,564
はい、ではソロを歌います！ドーン！ってなんだ、はい。
Yes, then I will sing a solo! Boom! What's that, right.

420
00:43:08,624 --> 00:43:11,484
青い惑星に生まれて
Born on this blue planet,

421
00:43:12,004 --> 00:43:14,684
違う道を歩いて
walking down different paths,

422
00:43:14,984 --> 00:43:18,504
たどり着いたこの街
arriving at this city where

423
00:43:19,024 --> 00:43:22,484
光る粒が弾けた
glowing particles burst forth.

424
00:43:22,984 --> 00:43:26,564
巡る夜にキミと出会い
Meeting you in the revolving night,

425
00:43:26,924 --> 00:43:29,904
いつの間にか手をつないで
before I knew it, our hands met.

426
00:43:30,404 --> 00:43:33,504
笑い声と弾む足で
With laughter and bouncing steps,

427
00:43:33,864 --> 00:43:37,464
どこまでも駆けるミッドナイト
running anywhere in the midnight.

428
00:43:40,044 --> 00:43:42,604
見上げた空星の光
Looking up at the starry sky,

429
00:43:42,984 --> 00:43:46,464
街のネオンが混ざり合って
the city's neon lights blend together.

430
00:43:46,944 --> 00:43:50,864
憂鬱な日々と忘れて
Forgetting the gloomy days,

431
00:43:51,164 --> 00:43:55,084
痛い・辛いとか、苦しい・暗いはもう全部捨て去って
throwing away all the pain, hardship, and darkness.

432
00:43:55,444 --> 00:43:58,804
ボクらもっと自由なはず
We should be much freer.

433
00:43:59,144 --> 00:44:02,464
閉ざした羽を開いたなら
If we open our closed wings,

434
00:44:02,784 --> 00:44:05,864
退屈な日々にさようなら
say goodbye to these tedious days.

435
00:44:06,244 --> 00:44:09,584
夜の街を行こうさあ
Let's go into the night city, come on.

436
00:44:17,444 --> 00:44:20,464
ビルを抜けて
Slipping through the buildings,

437
00:44:20,724 --> 00:44:24,224
街を追い越して
outpacing the city,

438
00:44:24,464 --> 00:44:27,784
さらば青い惑星
farewell, blue planet.

439
00:44:28,224 --> 00:44:31,804
なんて惚けてどこまで行こう
How dazzled shall we go?

440
00:44:32,464 --> 00:44:37,544
変わらないものなど何もないから
Since nothing in this world remains unchanged,

441
00:44:37,924 --> 00:44:46,664
たった一つ 確かな今を刻んで
carve out this one certain present moment.

442
00:45:04,384 --> 00:45:07,714
踊る夜にキミを連れて
Taking you along into the dancing night,

443
00:45:07,914 --> 00:45:11,674
邪魔なものは何もなくて
With nothing in our way at all,

444
00:45:12,004 --> 00:45:15,614
歌う声と軽い足で
With singing voices and light steps,

445
00:45:15,814 --> 00:45:19,074
いつまでも駆けるミッドナイト
Running endlessly through the midnight.

446
00:45:21,124 --> 00:45:24,884
見上げた空 月の光
Looking up at the moonlight in the sky,

447
00:45:25,084 --> 00:45:28,984
街の幻想が惹かれ合って
The city's illusions are drawn together,

448
00:45:29,184 --> 00:45:32,024
退屈な日々を忘れて
Forgetting these tedious days,

449
00:45:32,224 --> 00:45:36,024
痛いとか、苦いはもう全部捨て去って
Throwing away all the pain and bitterness.

450
00:45:36,224 --> 00:45:40,024
見上げた空 星の光
Looking up at the starlight in the sky,

451
00:45:40,224 --> 00:45:44,024
街のネオンが混じり合って
The city's neon lights blending together,

452
00:45:44,224 --> 00:45:47,124
退屈な日々にさようなら
Saying goodbye to these tedious days,

453
00:45:47,324 --> 00:45:50,924
ボクの手を取ってさあ
Take my hand, come on.

454
00:46:42,572 --> 00:46:46,922
だって、私 いつまでもずっと囚われ
After all, I've always been captured forever,

455
00:46:47,072 --> 00:46:50,022
君以外はもうありえない
There's no one for me but you.

456
00:46:50,222 --> 00:46:53,022
ちょっといつもふらふら
Always acting a bit fickle and unsteady,

457
00:46:53,222 --> 00:46:57,072
そっぽ向くの？ 思わせぶり許さないからね
Looking away? I won't forgive your teasing.

458
00:46:57,222 --> 00:47:00,022
好きだって かわいいねって
Saying you love me, calling me cute,

459
00:47:00,222 --> 00:47:04,022
甘やして盲信 あのね 無理だって
Spoiling me into blind faith—hey, "no way," you say,

460
00:47:04,222 --> 00:47:08,122
いけるよって 揺れたって篭絡
Saying "you can do it," swaying me with sweet talk.

461
00:47:08,322 --> 00:47:12,022
ガラスハートを振り回して
Swinging around a glass heart,

462
00:47:12,222 --> 00:47:14,272
骨の髄までしゃぶり尽くして
Sucking me dry to the marrow,

463
00:47:14,472 --> 00:47:17,122
壊れるほど惑わせて
Bewitching me until I break.

464
00:47:17,222 --> 00:47:20,022
you know you know you know

465
00:47:20,222 --> 00:47:24,522
love you 手のひらで転がして
love you, rolling me in the palm of your hand,

466
00:47:24,722 --> 00:47:29,322
彗級銀河を駆け巡って 痺れる声はライメイ
Racing across the galaxy, the numbing voice is Raimei!

467
00:47:33,872 --> 00:47:36,072
勝手な妄想なんだけど
It's just my selfish delusion, but

468
00:47:36,222 --> 00:47:42,022
こっち向いて 君以外はもう愛せない
Look this way, I can't love anyone but you.

469
00:47:42,222 --> 00:47:50,072
きっと気紛れなんだけど いつか私、ヤキモチで狂いそうだから
I'm sure I'm just moody, but someday I'll go crazy with jealousy, so

470
00:47:50,222 --> 00:47:55,022
貢いじゃって イラついちゃって 突き付けたい銃口
Giving everything, getting irritated, the muzzle I want to point at you.

471
00:47:55,222 --> 00:48:00,022
これはサンクコスト？ ただの愛憎？ なんだっていいけど
Is this a sunk cost? Just love and hate? Whatever it is is fine, but

472
00:48:00,222 --> 00:48:03,122
自分ファーストで手懐けて
Taming me by putting yourself first,

473
